|---|---|---|
| 1 | No `helmet`, CORS, rate-limit, body-size limit | **High** |
| 2 | No 404 / global error handler / process handlers | **High** |
| 3 | No input validation framework in place | **High** |
| 4 | PII exposed without auth in `/users` | Medium |
| 5 | Hardcoded port; `app.listen` in same file as exports | Medium |
| 6 | Unstructured `console.log` logging | Low–Med |
| 7 | No graceful shutdown | Low |

